function chooseGranuleUrl(urls){const scientific=/\.(nc|nc4|h5|hdf5|he5|hdf|tif|tiff|csv|json|geojson)(?:$|[?#])/i,bad=/opendap|thredds|browse|documentation|metadata|s3/i,score=x=>{let s=0;if(/^https:/i.test(x.url))s+=20;else if(/^http:/i.test(x.url))s+=10;if(/GET DATA/i.test(x.type))s+=30;if(/USE SERVICE API/i.test(x.type))s+=10;if(scientific.test(x.url))s+=80;if(bad.test(x.sub+' '+x.desc+' '+x.type))s-=60;if(/\.xml(?:$|[?#])/i.test(x.url))s-=80;return s};return urls.filter(x=>/^https?:/i.test(x.url)).sort((a,b)=>score(b)-score(a))[0]}
